  "notes": "Per-owner kost room for the 4-player preview test. Based on Baymax njh_kos (preview/main-interiors-kost-warteg, same layout as draft1 njh_kos) but the shower is replaced by a WC/kamar mandi: sekat_wc partition, squat_toilet, water_tub (bak + gayung, no separate gayung TYPE), wall-mounted sink (rot 90). No shower. Furniture types are all in the NJH preview catalog. ownerId is 'ichsan' (player t_ichsan). access=shared_partner for kasur and WC; owner_only for kulkas and lemari. Dressing props are shared_partner. Schema has no official owner field, so ownerId, access, and tags are all set. Paths stay clear; each used item has a free interaction-side tile. Preview only.",
